{"id":"bdcaf927aa04d82b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-iteration.md","title":"Iteration","display":"df-iteration — Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-iteration","aliases":["58-df-iteration","Iteration"],"display":"df-iteration — Iteration","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-iteration</span><span>Iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iteration — Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:X\\to X\">\\(F:X\\to X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>（序数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^n(x)\">\\(F^n(x)\\)</span>（有限次迭代）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（此处定义的非零极限序数谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X\">\\(\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}\">\\(I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}\\)</span>（长度为集合序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1\">\\(\\alpha+1\\)</span> 的迭代）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（此处定义的有界超限迭代谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}finite}\\vdash F^0(x)\\coloneqq x\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(F^{n+1}(x)\\coloneqq F(F^n(x)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}finite}\\vdash F^0(x)\\coloneqq x\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(F^{n+1}(x)\\coloneqq F(F^n(x)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}local} \\vdash \\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}local} \\vdash \\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}transfinite}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S(I,F,\\Lambda,x,X,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land F:X\\to X\\land x\\in X\\land I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}\\land\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X\\land I(0)=x\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;(I(\\beta+1)=F(I(\\beta)))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;(\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\to I(\\lambda)=\\Lambda(\\lambda,I\\upharpoonright\\lambda))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}transfinite}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S(I,F,\\Lambda,x,X,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land F:X\\to X\\land x\\in X\\land I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}\\land\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X\\land I(0)=x\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;(I(\\beta+1)=F(I(\\beta)))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;(\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\to I(\\lambda)=\\Lambda(\\lambda,I\\upharpoonright\\lambda))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>任意自映射都有有限迭代；超限迭代还必须给出极限阶段规则。这里把长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 作为显式集合序数参数，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to X\">\\(I:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to X\\)</span> 误写成集合函数。</li>\n<li>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的元素是集合且极限规则明确取并、并且该并仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中时，才能令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda(\\alpha,s)=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(s)\">\\(\\Lambda(\\alpha,s)=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>轨道为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{F^n(x):n\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{F^n(x):n\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>；若某阶段满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(\\alpha)=I(\\alpha+1)\">\\(I(\\alpha)=I(\\alpha+1)\\)</span>，则出现不动点。</li>\n<li>forcing iteration 的极限支持、累积层级的取并规则都是具体的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>，不能从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:X\\to X\">\\(F:X\\to X\\)</span> 单独推出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$（序数谓词，见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"F^n(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}finite}\\vdash F^0(x)\\coloneqq x\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(F^{n+1}(x)\\coloneqq F(F^n(x)))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}local} \\vdash \\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}transfinite}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransfiniteIteration}_S(I,F,\\Lambda,x,X,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land F:X\\to X\\land x\\in X\\land I\\in X^{\\alpha+1}\\land\\Lambda:\\{\\langle\\lambda,s\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\land s\\in X^\\lambda\\}\\to X\\land I(0)=x\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;(I(\\beta+1)=F(I(\\beta)))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;(\\operatorname{LimOrd}_S(\\lambda)\\to I(\\lambda)=\\Lambda(\\lambda,I\\upharpoonright\\lambda))","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda(\\alpha,s)=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{F^n(x):n\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I(\\alpha)=I(\\alpha+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"F:X\\to X","display":false}],"bytes":2384,"backlinks":[{"id":"b22a6e1e78d533a6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T^n$ (有限函数迭代, see [[../batch17/58-df-iteration.md]])"},{"id":"e7f727658115b818","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\in X^X$, $A\\subseteq X$, and $x\\in A$; $T^n(x)$ is the finite iterate from [[58-df-iteration]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-710","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-iteration.md|58-df-iteration]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}